# Theme updates

## Source versions

- New theme drops go in `themes/` (e.g. `themes/trafigura-vX/`).
- When asked to update from a version there, merge/adapt into the live theme root (not leave the site running from `themes/`).
- Preserve local customizations (listed below + SEO folder + this rules folder) unless the user says otherwise.

## After every theme sync — re-apply checklist

Run through these; Udesly/Webflow exports often wipe them.

### 1. News & partner stories order (required)

In `template-parts/query/`:

- All `news-*.php` queries: `"order" => "DESC"`
- All `partner-stories-*.php` queries: `"order" => "DESC"`

Do **not** leave Webflow/Udesly defaults of `"order" => "ASC"`.

```php
// ❌ BAD — oldest first
"order" => "ASC",

// ✅ GOOD — newest first
"order" => "DESC",
```

### 2. Content Hub H1 casing

- File: `template-parts/content/page-content-hub.php`
- H1 must be **`Content Hub`** (not lowercase `content hub` from Udesly `_u()`).
- Prefer hardcoded text over `_u('tn17498f32','text')` so DB/editor overrides cannot regress it.
- Also keep `_data/frontend-editor/page-content-hub.json` key `tn17498f32` = `Content Hub`.

### 3. Homepage performance (hero video + GTM)

**Poster asset (must exist):** `assets/images/home-hero-poster.jpg`

**`template-parts/content/front-page.php` — home hero:**

- Show local poster `<img class="hero-poster no-lazy">` with `fetchpriority="high"`, `loading="eager"`, `data-no-lazy="1"` for LCP (W3TC must not lazy-load it).
- Do **not** put `<source src="...">` in the HTML (avoids downloading ~6.7MB Webflow video on mobile).
- Video element keeps `data-mp4` / `data-webm` from `_u('i-5fdbe129')` / `_u('i64642473')`.
- Inline script loads sources **only** when `min-width: 992px` and not `prefers-reduced-motion`, after `requestIdleCallback` / load.
- Mobile / reduced-motion: poster only.

**`template-parts/head/front-page.php`:**

- `<link rel="preload" as="image" href=".../home-hero-poster.jpg" fetchpriority="high">`
- Keep small CSS for `.hero-poster` / `.hero-video-wrap` stacking; hide video wrap on `max-width: 991px`.

**GTM (all templates):**

- Shared partial: `template-parts/head/partials/gtm-deferred.php`
- Keep GTM (analytics); **gtag/GA loads from the GTM container** — do not add a separate gtag snippet.
- Load on first interaction **or** idle (timeout ~6s) — do **not** restore the blocking GTM snippet.

### 3b. Fonts (Euclid → WOFF2 + Bebas deferred)

- Prefer `assets/fonts/euclid-circular-b-*.woff2` in CSS `@font-face` (weights **400 / 500 / 600** only).
- Homepage preloads Euclid medium woff2.
- Bebas Neue via `bebas-font.php` **after idle/load** (JS inject) — do **not** put a blocking Google Fonts `<link rel="stylesheet">` in `<head>` (W3TC duplicates it).
- Enqueue **one** CSS file: `assets/css/trafigura-bundle.css` (= normalize + components + staging). Rebuild the bundle after editing any of those sources:
  `cat assets/css/normalize.css assets/css/components.css assets/css/trafigura-staging.css > assets/css/trafigura-bundle.css`

### 3c. Listing images (card src + OceanImageBank)

**`functions.php` helpers:**

- `trafigura_card_image( $sizes )` — prefers `medium_large` + `sizes`; used by news/partner listing query templates
- `trafigura_optimized_image_override( $thumb_id )` — serves theme-compressed copies from `assets/images/optimized/` for known heavy uploads (e.g. `OceanImageBank_AriphRasheed_07`)

**Re-wire after sync:** any `news-*.php` / `partner-stories-*.php` card `<img>` that still uses raw `udesly_get_image()->src` should use `trafigura_card_image()` instead.

### 3d. Render-blocking cleanup (keep in `functions.php` + `footer.php`)

- `trafigura_dequeue_unused_assets()` — dequeues block-library, Elementor Roboto fonts, and Elementor frontend/kit CSS when the page has no Elementor content (`trafigura_page_needs_elementor_css()`)
- `elementor/frontend/print_google_fonts` → false
- jQuery is marked footer-group via `trafigura_jquery_in_footer()`, then **`footer.php` calls `wp_print_scripts( 'jquery' )` immediately before** theme/GSAP/Swiper/Netlify scripts — do not put those scripts before jQuery again
- Host former Netlify extras from theme `code/` (`style.css`, `script.js`, page-specific JS/CSS) — do **not** restore `https://trafigura-code.netlify.app/...` URLs
- Optional helper: `trafigura_code_uri( $path )` in `functions.php`
- **Never** set `.main-wrapper { opacity: 0 }` waiting for GSAP — that blanks the filmstrip and destroys mobile FCP. `code/script.js` must not fade the whole main wrapper in on load.
- Homepage H1 must **not** use `animation="loading"` (GSAP starts those at opacity 0 and delays LCP until scripts load).
### 4. Internal linking helpers + templates

**`functions.php` — keep these helpers:**

- `trafigura_area_of_work_url( $slug )`
- `trafigura_link_areas_of_work_text( $text )` — turns PlainText area labels into pillar links
- `trafigura_card_image( $sizes )` / `trafigura_optimized_image_override( $thumb_id )` — listing image sizing + OceanImageBank overrides
- `trafigura_code_uri( $path )` — local `code/` assets (ex-Netlify)

**Re-wire after sync:**

| File | What to restore |
|---|---|
| `template-parts/content/front-page.php` | Pillar `supply-item` H3s → area-of-work permalinks; “CONTENT HUB” H2 → `/content-hub/`; partners heading → `/partners-stories/` |
| `template-parts/content/page-areas-of-work.php` | Same pillar `supply-item` links |
| `template-parts/content/page-content-hub.php` | “Explore our partners” CTA → `/partners-stories/` |
| `template-parts/content/single-news.php` | “Explore our partners” CTA before Other Spotlights |
| `template-parts/content/single-partner-stories.php` | Area-of-work tag(s) via `trafigura_link_areas_of_work_text()` |
| `template-parts/query/partner-stories-sorted-by-post_date.php` | `partner--area` uses `trafigura_link_areas_of_work_text()` |
| `template-parts/query/partner-stories-sorted-by-post_date-v0.php` | Same (used on area-of-work singles) |

Pillar slugs: `prepared-communities`, `thriving-nature`, `sustainable-livelihoods`.

### 5. SEO / IA context (not always in theme files)

Public hubs (index): `/content-hub/` · `/partners-stories/` · `/areas-of-work/`  
Hidden CPT archives: `/news/` · `/partner-stories/` · `/area-of-work/` → noindex and/or 301 to hubs  

Trackers live in `SEO/` (`yoast-meta-all-pages.csv`, `news-to-partner-links.csv`, `CHECKLIST-big-wins.md`) — do not delete on theme replace.

