1. Grep query templates for `"order" => "ASC"` on news/partner-stories → fix to DESC  
2. View-source homepage: poster preload present; no hero `<source src=` until desktop JS  
3. Content Hub H1 = `Content Hub`  
4. Home pillars + Content Hub/Partners headings are links  
5. `home-hero-poster.jpg` exists under `assets/images/`
6. Head templates include deferred GTM partial (not blocking snippet)
7. Euclid `@font-face` prefers `.woff2`
8. News/partner card imgs use `trafigura_card_image()`; `assets/images/optimized/` present
